---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Consulting — Kostis Dovelos"
  description="Dovelos Engineering: a wireless engineering consultancy serving defense, space, and telecom clients, from algorithm design and fixed-point modelling to DSP/FPGA implementation and field testing."
>
  <section class="about-grid">
    <article class="prose">
      <h2 class="section-head">Consulting</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">
        Dovelos Engineering is a wireless engineering consultancy serving defense, space, and
        telecom clients. Backed by a decade of academic research and industrial experience, we bridge
        the gap between mathematical theory and hardware, taking communications systems from algorithm
        design to DSP/FPGA implementation and field testing.
      </p>
    </article>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2 class="section-head">Capabilities</h2>
      <ul class="capability-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Waveform &amp; PHY design.</strong> Custom waveform and baseband transceiver design
          for harsh propagation environments, such as high-Doppler and low-SNR regimes.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>SDR &amp; link engineering.</strong> SDR architecture definition, link-budget
          analysis, and digital front-end optimisation.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>FPGA &amp; DSP implementation.</strong> Fixed-point modelling of baseband
          algorithms, high-level synthesis, and RTL verification via cocotb. Resource-constrained
          implementation of DSP pipelines for embedded platforms.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Array processing.</strong> Direction finding, interference mitigation algorithms,
          MIMO and diversity schemes.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Integration &amp; testing.</strong> System evaluation, characterization, and field
          testing of digital links.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2 class="section-head">Engagement models</h2>
      <ul class="capability-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Technical consulting.</strong> Targeted architecture sprints, fixed-scope contract
          engineering, and technical advisory for specialized DSP and physical-layer challenges.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Consortium partnerships.</strong> Joint R&amp;D proposals for ESA, European, and
          national space initiatives.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
